    "detailed_description": "The title explains what it is.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n1. 14 brand new minesweeper variants, each with four difficulties, hundreds of levels, and unique logic.<br />\r\nThere is no need to play 14 Minesweeper Variants before this since the new variants are completely different.<br />\r\n2. Non-numeric clues and non-integer clues.<br />\r\n3. A friendly hint system that tells you where to focus when you get stuck, while it does not simply tell the solution.<br />\r\n4. The puzzles are procedurally generated but don't feel like procedurally generated.<br />\r\n5. Once again, there's more to explore.",
